# Every line, including the optional automation and layout lines, is explained in examples/template.venue.
# Holy Mosques - Makkah (Masjid al-Haram) and Madinah (Al-Masjid an-Nabawi)
#
# The layout follows the real arrangement of both mosques: in Makkah the Kaaba and the Mataf in the
# centre, the Mas'a along the east side from Al-Safa (south) to Al-Marwa (north), the King Fahd
# expansion to the west, the King Abdullah expansion to the north, and the outer courtyards on every
# side; in Madinah the old mosque with the Rawdah at the south, the north expansion halls, the main
# gates (Bab al-Salam, Bab Jibreel, Bab al-Baqi, King Fahd Gate) and the courtyards around it.
# It is a SCHEMATIC for this software: positions are approximate, and capacities, gate flows and
# walking times are estimates. Replace them with the official figures and plans of the General
# Authority for the Affairs of the Two Holy Mosques before real use.
#
# map units: 1 unit = about 1 metre; walking times between areas are worked out from the drawing (auto).
venue: Holy Mosques - Makkah and Madinah
code: umrah
thresholds: 50 75 90

auto: CROWD HIGH trend
exit: S-PLAZA W-PLAZA N-PLAZA E-PLAZA NORTH-YARD S-YARD W-YARD E-YARD
supervision: 15
ack: 2
meeting: KA-GATE SALAM
event: 12:15 | 60 | Makkah | Dhuhr prayer
event: 18:00 | 75 | Makkah | Maghrib and Isha prayers
event: 12:15 | 60 | Madinah | Dhuhr prayer (Madinah)
shift: 06:00 14:00 22:00

map: umrah-map.png 1800 1000
scale: 1.0

# ---------------- Makkah: Masjid al-Haram
area: MATAF | Mataf (around the Kaaba) | Makkah | COURTYARD | 30000
area: MATAF-UP | Mataf upper levels and bridge | Makkah | COURTYARD | 20000
area: HALLS-W | King Fahd expansion halls (west) | Makkah | HALL | 50000
area: KABDULLAH | King Abdullah expansion (north) | Makkah | HALL | 60000
area: MASAA | Mas'a (Safa to Marwa) | Makkah | CORRIDOR | 20000
area: KA-GATE | King Abdulaziz Gate | Makkah | GATE | 5000
area: KF-GATE | King Fahd Gate | Makkah | GATE | 5000
area: UMRAH-GATE | Umrah Gate | Makkah | GATE | 4000
area: SAFA-GATE | Al-Safa Gate | Makkah | GATE | 3000
area: MARWA-GATE | Al-Marwa Gate | Makkah | GATE | 3000
area: S-PLAZA | South courtyard (Ajyad, Clock Tower) | Makkah | COURTYARD | 60000
area: W-PLAZA | West courtyard | Makkah | COURTYARD | 40000
area: N-PLAZA | North courtyards (Al-Shamiya) | Makkah | COURTYARD | 60000
area: E-PLAZA | East courtyard (Al-Ghazza) | Makkah | COURTYARD | 30000
area: SEC-A | Security Zone A | Makkah | RESTRICTED | 100 | restricted

# ---------------- Madinah: Al-Masjid an-Nabawi
area: RAWDAH | Al-Rawdah al-Sharifah | Madinah | ZONE | 1500
area: OLD-MOSQUE | Old mosque prayer halls (south) | Madinah | HALL | 40000
area: NORTH-HALL | North expansion halls | Madinah | HALL | 80000
