area: NORTH-YARD | North Courtyard | Madinah | COURTYARD | 25000
area: S-YARD | South courtyard (Quba road side) | Madinah | COURTYARD | 30000
area: W-YARD | West courtyard | Madinah | COURTYARD | 30000
area: E-YARD | East courtyard (Al-Baqi side) | Madinah | COURTYARD | 25000

